      "short": "Bars centred at $0,2,4,6,8$ have heights $2,3,5,1,4$. The completed histogram and polygon are shown.",
      "worked": "The score interval is $2$, so draw touching bars of width $2$, with boundaries $-1,1,3,5,7,9$ and heights $2,3,5,1,4$. Join the column-top centres $(0,2),(2,3),(4,5),(6,1),(8,4)$. Extend to $(-2,0)$ and $(10,0)$, one score interval beyond the first and last centres.",
